('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000374', 'reading', 11, '{"passage": "Nominalized nouns also describe change and patterns in data. ''Reduce'' becomes ''reduction'', ''distribute'' becomes ''distribution'', ''correlate'' becomes ''correlation'', ''emerge'' becomes ''emergence'', ''occur'' becomes ''occurrence'', and ''vary'' becomes ''variation''. These words are especially common in reports that describe trends, statistics and research results.", "translation": "Substantivos nominalizados também descrevem mudança e padrões em dados. ''Reduce'' vira ''reduction'', ''distribute'' vira ''distribution'', ''correlate'' vira ''correlation'', ''emerge'' vira ''emergence'', ''occur'' vira ''occurrence'', e ''vary'' vira ''variation''. Essas palavras são especialmente comuns em relatórios que descrevem tendências, estatísticas e resultados de pesquisas.", "question": "Where are these words especially common, according to the text?", "options": ["In reports about trends, statistics and research", "In casual text messages", "In children''s stories"], "correct_index": 0}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000374', 'listening', 12, '{"audio_text": "The company achieved a significant reduction in expenses. The emergence of new technologies changed the industry. There is considerable variation in the results across regions.", "question": "What did the company achieve, according to the audio?", "options": ["A significant reduction in expenses", "A new correlation", "A common occurrence"], "correct_index": 0}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000374', 'dictation', 13, '{"audio_text": "There is a strong correlation between the two variables.", "expected": "There is a strong correlation between the two variables."}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000374', 'typing', 14, '{"prompt_pt": "Traduza: ''O surgimento dessa tecnologia levou a uma redução nos custos e a uma variação nos resultados.''", "expected": "The emergence of this technology led to a reduction in costs and a variation in the results.", "ai_review": true}'),

